The Reef Wallet is a truly exceptional accessory. Its high quality is evident from the first glance, thanks to the use of first-grade Italian veg-tanned leather. This type of leather is known for its durability and elegance, ensuring that the Reef wallet will last for years to come.

The wallet's design is both practical and stylish. With eight card slots, there is ample space for all of your important cards. Additionally, there is a convenient coin pocket and two large slots, perfect for keeping receipts or other important documents.

One of the standout features of the Reef wallet is its attention to detail. The wallet has been carefully crafted to ensure that each stitch is perfectly placed, and that all seams are strong and durable. This level of craftsmanship is hard to find in today's market, making the Reef Wallet a truly unique and special item.

Overall, the Reef wallet is an excellent choice for anyone looking for a high-quality, long-lasting accessory. Its combination of style and practicality make it the perfect addition to any wardrobe.

This wallet is originally designer by Deyan at [@dsleathergoods](https://instagram.com/dsleathergoods). If you are a crafter, you can find the [wallet pattern](https://www.etsy.com/listing/1380793657/the-reef-wallet-pattern-pdf-leather?utm_source=lord.crofte.fr) here.

